WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:03.666
- My wife Mrs. Unlimited said I have to be a lifestyle brand now.

00:00:04.041 --> 00:00:05.583
Lockett up that cash, right?

00:00:05.666 --> 00:00:06.833
- Totally, Russ.

00:00:06.916 --> 00:00:08.916
God, he’s so lame but so good at football.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.333
- So we're finding spots around Gridiron Heights that will...

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.916
Say it with me, 12s.

00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:14.583
Let. Russ. Cook.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:15.583
- We can't have fans yet.

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:16.291
- Oh.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:17.666
Our first stop is in Atlanta, 

00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:20.125
home to the two-time Super Bowl-losing Falcons.

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:22.166
I’m here with Lemon Pepper Matt—

00:00:22.291 --> 00:00:23.000
- No one calls me that. 

00:00:23.041 --> 00:00:25.208
So what I do is toss the wings to Julio for a bit

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:26.916
but then let Calvin Ridley finish them off. 

00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:27.708
For the cornbread—

00:00:27.791 --> 00:00:29.250
- I like to make things cornier.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:29.958
- No, but I—

00:00:30.041 --> 00:00:32.208
- Then turn on the burners and scramble!

00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:34.041
- WHY DID YOU LET HIM TURN ON THE GAS, DAN? 

00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:35.333
- I’M TRYING MY BEST.

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:36.666
- Thanks for letting me cook, Atlanta. 

00:00:36.666 --> 00:00:38.875
There’s nothing I like more than cooking at home, 

00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:41.208
and I’m pretty sure all of my guests like it too.

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:43.083
- You just let him ignore your recipe?

00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:45.250
- Yeah, we tried not to for years but, uh, whatever.

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:46.000
- ALL DONE.

00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:49.083
- Already? But Jerry said it takes time to evaluate if something’s good!

00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:53.416
- [Russell Wilson:] At the end of the day, the real MVP is 
someone who enjoys time with their team. 

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.416
But also, please, please vote for me for MVP.

00:00:55.666 --> 00:00:58.125
Stay tuned for our spin-off, “LET DALVIN COOK.”

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.875
- BRO, JUST GIVE ME THE EGG. 

00:01:02.541 --> 00:01:04.791
- [Together:] TEAMY WANTS YOU TO SUBSCRIBE,

00:01:05.291 --> 00:01:06.791
But Teamy also wants…

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:08.416
a hug.

00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:12.083
Just because we be Team Monster

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.291
doesn't mean we be monster monster.

00:01:16.458 --> 00:01:18.625
AHHHH MUST EAT TO SURVIVE!

